/target
Cargo.lock
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build outputs at the repo root only — shell/web/dist is a committed
# build artifact (AGENTS §7) and must NOT be ignored.
/dist/
node_modules/
# The web shell's dependency tree rides a wt cache symlink — untracked, and
# (2026-10-25) the two accidental `git add -A` inclusions of the symlink
# itself (justfile + caller-refresh waves) both came from this path being
# outside the root-only `node_modules/` rule. Match it anywhere.
#
# The trailing-slash form above only matches DIRECTORIES, so the symlink form
# (`node_modules -> /machine-local/path`, created by the worktree cache link)
# walked straight past it and got committed twice more — most recently in the
# devtools-anchor wave. This pattern has no trailing slash on purpose: it
# matches a file, a directory AND a symlink of that name at any depth.
**/node_modules

# celestia-devtools: staged-on-demand shared justfile recipes (just fetch)
/.just/
/celestia-devtools.just
packages/*/node_modules
packages/*/pnpm-lock.yaml
packages/*/pnpm-workspace.yaml

# shun demo payloads generated by the examples
*.shun

# tauri-build generated capability schemas
shell/gen/

# staged demo application binaries (built by scripts/stage-demo-payload.sh)
/examples/demo_payload/bin/
